      en: ["The Southern Desert covers about 15% of Iraq's total geographic area.", "It is bordered to the east by the Wadi al-Batin, a natural depression.", "The Darb Zubaidah pilgrimage route contains dozens of ancient water stations.", "The terrain consists of flat limestone plateaus and gravel plains.", "Annual rainfall in the region is extremely low, often below 150mm.", "The area is vital for traditional nomadic grazing of sheep and camels."],
